        "TileImage": "$($repository 6a7d576d-df71-4207-a409-c671b949ceeb).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Tonight your targets are three of the most evil people in the whole world. What makes them so evil? Well for one, they were all involved with that whole pedo island debacle, not to mention getting soda in the free water cup at McDonald&apos;s. I see no other choice but to incinerate them as soon as possible. Good luck, 47.\r\rP.S. Can you please stop peeing in the safehouse bathroom sink? It has become rather pungent as of late. Thanks.",
